/// Upper-Body Hypertrophy, 3 days a week. Arms priority. Machines, no squat rack.
/// Paste this whole file into Liftosaur: Programs -> New program -> full text mode.
/// Starting weights assume roughly 75-85 kg with no lifting background. Adjust in week 1.

// **Read this first**
// * Mon / Wed / Fri, or any three non-consecutive days. A, B, C in order.
// * Every exercise note starts with a colour. 🟢 MAIN = presses and pulls, never skip. 🟠 ARMS = the pair, 45 sec between. ⚪ EXTRA = delts, flyes, legs, cut these if short on time.
// * Weeks 1 to 3: stop 3 to 4 reps short of failure. From week 4: 1 to 2 short. Last set of arm work can go to failure.
// * Progression is automatic: complete every prescribed rep and the app adds a rep next time, then weight at the top of the range.
// * Tired day and you lowered the weight? After the last set of that exercise tap **Suppress** next to the progress note, so next session keeps your normal numbers. Otherwise the app builds on the lighter weight.
// * Ramp-up sets are built in where needed. Nothing else needs a warm-up.
// * Every exercise note names its substitute and shows a video for both. Machine taken? Tap the exercise, Swap Exercise, pick the named one from the program list. It brings its own weight and progression.
// * Outside the gym: 1.6 to 2.2 g protein per kg, small calorie surplus, 3 to 5 g creatine daily, 7 to 9 hours sleep.
# Week 1


// 🟢 **main:** chest press, lat pulldown, cable row.
// 🟠 **arms:** incline curl + overhead extension, paired.
// ⚪ **extra:** lateral raise, shrug, hack squat. Cut here if short on time.
// Machine taken? Tap the exercise, Swap Exercise, and pick the one named in its note from the program list. It brings its own weight and progression.
## Day A

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwzUje3z0qY) · Sub: swap to *main: Bench Press, Dumbbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YQ2s_Y7g5Qk)
// Handles at mid-chest height. Full stretch at the back, elbows about 45° from the body.
main: Chest Press, Leverage Machine / 3x6 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 6, 10)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EUIri47Epcg) · Sub: swap to *sub: Pull Up* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ygapPMYK1I)
// Slight lean back, pull the bar to the upper chest, drive elbows down. Full stretch at the top.
main: Lat Pulldown, Cable / 3x8 40kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UCXxvVItLoM) · Sub: swap to *main: Chest-Supported Row* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0UBRfiO4zDs)
// Let the shoulder blades reach forward at the start, then pull to the lower ribs.
main: Seated Row, Cable / 3x8 40kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aTYlqC_JacQ) · Sub: swap to *sub: Bicep Curl, Dumbbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iixND1P2lik)
// Bench at about 45°, arms hanging straight down and slightly back. Curl without moving the upper arm.
arms: Incline Curl, Dumbbell / 4x8 8kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: A / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kqidUIf1eJE) · Sub: swap to *arms: Triceps Extension, Dumbbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YbX7Wd8jQ-Q)
// Overhead, rope. Face away from the stack, elbows by the ears, deep stretch behind the head each rep.
arms: Triceps Extension, Cable / 4x10 25kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: A / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3VcKaXpzqRo) · Sub: swap to *sub: Lateral Raise, Cable* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lq7eLC30b9w)
// Slight forward lean, lead with the elbows, stop at shoulder height. Light weight, no swinging.
extra: Lateral Raise, Dumbbell / 3x12 6kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(1kg, 12, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_t3lrPI6Ns4) · Sub: swap to *sub: Shrug, Barbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_MjF5Nm_h4)
// Full stretch at the bottom, shrug straight up, hold 1 second at the top. No rolling.
extra: Shrug, Dumbbell / 3x10 22kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rYgNArpwE7E) · Sub: swap to *extra: Leg Press* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yZmx_Ac3880)
// Feet mid-platform, shoulder width. As deep as you can with heels down. Weight is plates only, not the sled.
extra: Hack Squat, Leverage Machine / 3x8 50kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 50% / progress: dp(10kg, 8, 12)


// 🟢 **main:** incline press, chest-supported row, shoulder press.
// 🟠 **arms:** preacher curl + pushdown, paired.
// ⚪ **extra:** pec deck, leg curl. Cut here if short on time.
// Machine taken? Tap the exercise, Swap Exercise, and pick the one named in its note from the program list. It brings its own weight and progression.
## Day B

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5CECBjd7HLQ) · Sub: swap to *sub: Incline Bench Press, Smith Machine* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8urE8Z8AMQ4)
// 30° bench. Deep stretch at upper-chest level, elbows about 45° out. Press up and slightly in.
main: Incline Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x6 12kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2kg, 6, 10)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0UBRfiO4zDs) · Sub: swap to *sub: Incline Row, Dumbbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nx0TzjgsI-0)
// Chest glued to the pad. Pull elbows back and squeeze the shoulder blades together.
main: Chest-Supported Row, Leverage Machine / 3x8 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WvLMauqrnK8) · Sub: swap to *sub: Shoulder Press, Dumbbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HzIiNhHhhtA)
// Start with handles at about chin height. Press up without flaring the ribs.
main: Shoulder Press, Leverage Machine / 3x8 25kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxA__DoLsgo) · Sub: swap to *sub: Preacher Curl, Leverage Machine* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_uPvGrMx_o)
// Armpits on top of the pad. Lower almost to straight arms, then curl. No shoulder movement. Weight includes the bar, about 8 kg.
arms: Preacher Curl, EZ Bar / 4x8 15kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: B / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6Fzep104f0s) · Sub: swap to *sub: Skullcrusher, EZ Bar* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQ4TWXkZjTc)
// Elbows pinned to the sides. Push to lockout, let the forearms come up past 90° on the way back.
arms: Triceps Pushdown, Cable / 4x10 25kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: B / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O-OBCfyh9Fw) · Sub: swap to *sub: Chest Fly, Cable* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mfLHnFL0Uw)
// Handles at chest height. Open wide to a stretch, then bring the arms together with a slight elbow bend.
extra: Pec Deck, Leverage Machine / 2x10 35kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Orxowest56U) · Sub: swap to *sub: Lying Leg Curl* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n5WDXD_mpVY)
// Pad just above the heels. Curl all the way down and control the return.
extra: Seated Leg Curl, Leverage Machine / 3x8 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / progress: dp(5kg, 8, 12)


// 🟢 **main:** dumbbell bench, chin-up, one-arm row.
// 🟠 **arms:** Bayesian curl + dumbbell overhead extension, paired.
// ⚪ **extra:** reverse pec deck, shrug, leg press. Cut here if short on time.
// Machine taken? Tap the exercise, Swap Exercise, and pick the one named in its note from the program list. It brings its own weight and progression.
## Day C

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YQ2s_Y7g5Qk) · Sub: swap to *main: Chest Press, Leverage Machine* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwzUje3z0qY)
// Shoulder blades back and down. Deep stretch beside the chest, press up and slightly in.
main: Bench Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 14kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9JC1EwqezGY) · Sub: swap to *sub: Lat Pulldown, Cable* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRHLNfmr_oI)
// Underhand grip, palms facing you, shoulder width. Weight here is the ASSISTANCE, lower is harder. Full hang, chin over the bar.
main: Chin Up, Leverage Machine / 3x6 40kg 120s / warmup: 1x5 55kg / progress: dp(-2.5kg, 6, 10)

// 🟢 MAIN · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2kVniB5eQI) · Sub: swap to *main: Seated Row, Cable* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UCXxvVItLoM)
// Hand and knee on the bench. Let the dumbbell hang to a stretch, then row to the hip. No twisting.
main: Bent Over One Arm Row, Dumbbell / 3x8 16kg 120s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=paM4Yo8fo8g) · Sub: swap to *sub: Hammer Curl* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XOEL4MgekYE)
// Bayesian curl, one arm at a time. Low pulley behind you, step forward so the arm is stretched behind the torso. Upper arm fixed.
arms: Bicep Curl, Cable / 4x8 12.5kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: C / progress: dp(2.5kg, 8, 12)

// 🟠 ARMS · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YbX7Wd8jQ-Q) · Sub: swap to *sub: Skullcrusher, EZ Bar* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQ4TWXkZjTc)
// Both hands under one dumbbell, elbows pointing forward, lower behind the head to a deep stretch.
arms: Triceps Extension, Dumbbell / 4x10 16kg 45s / warmup: none / superset: C / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YK4bgzXDp0) · Sub: swap to *sub: Face Pull* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MODnZdnmAQ)
// Chest on the pad, arms slightly bent, sweep the handles back until the arms are in line with the shoulders.
extra: Reverse Fly, Leverage Machine / 3x12 30kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 12, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_t3lrPI6Ns4) · Sub: swap to *sub: Shrug, Barbell* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_MjF5Nm_h4)
// Full stretch at the bottom, shrug straight up, hold 1 second at the top. No rolling.
extra: Shrug, Dumbbell / 3x10 22kg 60s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ EXTRA · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yZmx_Ac3880) · Sub: swap to *sub: Leg Extension* [▶ video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0FOpMEgero)
// Feet shoulder width, lower until the thighs nearly touch the torso. Keep the lower back on the pad. Plates only, not the sled.
extra: Leg Press, Leverage Machine / 3x10 80kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50% / progress: dp(10kg, 10, 15)

/// Hidden substitutes. They do not appear in any day. In a workout, tap Swap Exercise and pick one
/// from the program exercises list: it comes with its own weight, sets, timer and progression.
// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ygapPMYK1I)
// Assisted pull-up, overhand. Weight is the ASSISTANCE, lower is harder. Substitute for the lat pulldown.
sub: Pull Up, Leverage Machine / 3x6 40kg 120s / warmup: 1x5 55kg / used: none / progress: dp(-2.5kg, 6, 10)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRHLNfmr_oI)
