sub: Skullcrusher, EZ Bar / 4x10 15kg 45s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lq7eLC30b9w)
// Leaning cable lateral raise, one arm at a time. Substitute for the dumbbell lateral raise.
