// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_MjF5Nm_h4)
// Barbell or Smith machine shrug, total including the bar. Substitute for the dumbbell shrug.
sub: Shrug, Barbell / 3x10 40kg 60s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8urE8Z8AMQ4)
// Total including the bar. Substitute for the incline dumbbell press.
sub: Incline Bench Press, Smith Machine / 3x6 30kg 120s / warmup: 1x8 50%, 1x4 75% / used: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 6, 10)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nx0TzjgsI-0)
// Chest on an incline bench, dumbbells. Substitute for the chest-supported row machine.
sub: Incline Row, Dumbbell / 3x8 12kg 120s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HzIiNhHhhtA)
// Seated dumbbell shoulder press. Substitute for the machine shoulder press.
sub: Shoulder Press, Dumbbell / 3x8 10kg 120s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(2kg, 8, 12)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mfLHnFL0Uw)
// Weight per side. Substitute for the pec deck.
sub: Chest Fly, Cable / 2x10 12.5kg 60s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 10, 15)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n5WDXD_mpVY)
// Substitute for the seated leg curl.
sub: Lying Leg Curl, Leverage Machine / 3x8 35kg 120s / warmup: 1x6 60% / used: none / progress: dp(5kg, 8, 12)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MODnZdnmAQ)
// Rope, pull to the face with elbows high. Substitute for the reverse pec deck.
sub: Face Pull, Cable / 3x12 20kg 60s / warmup: none / used: none / progress: dp(2.5kg, 12, 15)

// ⚪ SUB · [▶ Watch](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m0FOpMEgero)
